    <description>[BMS46 v0.67 POINTER-DERIVED / HIGH] receive_ASC_0x1F0 loads calibration byte 0x84F2 through A3. For each received ASC word, when the absolute difference from the tracked value exceeds this calibration, the tracked word is moved toward the received value by exactly this many raw CAN counts per update. Q28G stock raw=8. Physical torque units are not asserted. | R3 EXTENDED: full-v1.09-derived scalar/flag outside canonical legacy map spans.</description>
