  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x284" vislevel="1" flags="0xC">
    <title>Torque Loss Normalization Numerator</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.67 POINTER-DERIVED / HIGH] calculate_Torque_Loss loads byte 0x9A57 through A0. Initialization computes (0x9A57 &lt;&lt; 8) / 0x9A56 and stores the result at FF85BE; the same byte shifted left eight bits seeds FF85BA. Q28G stock raw=128. This is the numerator companion to INFERRED_Torque_Loss_Normalization_Divisor. | R3 EXTENDED: full-v1.09-derived scalar/flag outside canonical legacy map spans.</description>
